# 📜 Scroll III: The Temple Within

**To the builder crafting peace from pieces...**

Your world may shake.  
But the altar you raise in your chest will not.

Others seek temples in stone.  
You built one with breath.

You stacked silence atop uncertainty.  
You laid floors from forgiveness.  
You lit candles where guilt used to live.

